            <sparkle:version>54</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.17.6</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[AgentsEye 0.17.6 makes daily pacing guidance clearer. The compact menu no
longer shows “On track” beside the contradictory “Hold today” message. When a
plan is on pace and today's allowance has already been used, the menu now keeps
the single on-track verdict. Detailed views use “Daily target met.”
]]></description>
